openapi: 3.0.3
info:
  title: 🛒 Bazary E-Commerce API
  version: 1.0.0
  description: "\n# Bazary E-Commerce Backend API\n\nA comprehensive, production-ready\
    \ e-commerce API built with Django REST Framework.\n\n## \U0001F680 Key Features\n\
    - **Complete E-Commerce Solution**: Products, categories, shopping cart, payments\n\
    - **Advanced Search & Filtering**: Multi-field search with faceted filters\n-\
    \ **Payment Integration**: Chapa (Ethiopian) payment gateway with webhook support\n\
    - **User Management**: JWT authentication, email verification, admin controls\n\
    - **Product Variants**: Size, color, and custom product options\n- **Real-time\
    \ Inventory**: Stock tracking and low-stock alerts\n- **Admin Dashboard**: Bulk\
    \ operations and analytics\n\n## \U0001F510 Authentication\nMost endpoints require\
    \ JWT authentication. Get your access token from `/api/v1/auth/token/`.\n\n##\
    \ \U0001F4CA API Organization\nEndpoints are organized by user journey and logical\
    \ grouping:\n1. **Authentication Flow** - Login, registration, verification\n\
    2. **User Management** - Profiles, addresses, activity\n3. **Admin Operations**\
    \ - User & product management\n4. **Product Catalog** - Categories, products,\
    \ variants\n5. **Shopping Experience** - Discovery, search, cart\n6. **Payment\
    \ Processing** - Methods, transactions, webhooks\n7. **System Utilities** - Health\
    \ checks, testing guides\n\n## \U0001F9EA Testing\nComprehensive testing guides\
    \ available for each endpoint group.\n    "
  contact:
    name: Bazary API Support
    email: api-support@bazary.com
    url: https://github.com/legennd48/bazary/issues
  license:
    name: MIT License
    url: https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT
